production project (MRP)\n\nThe issue happens even in a completely empty project with no scenes or scripts.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}